+# Request accountability and limits
+
+- **Actual available original-record lead:** read the three expressly uninspected continuation images. S2p25/57 supplies a reported signed/dated note handoff and exact form/request/footer locators; the original notes remain missing.
+- **Source links and pins:** official PDF URLs, source hashes, physical/internal/footer/paragraph labels and image hashes preserved. No synthetic PDF line or native-note hash claimed.
+- **Preserve conflicting records:** both footer versions, printed case/date labels, 20/15/about10 duration accounts and direct/second-hand/tentative listening distinctions retained. No preferred source, silent repair or causal adjudication.
+- **Dependence and contrary evidence:** two Woodward copies are one reported account; a handoff statement is not the actual note. Air-phone wording refers to Ong, not automatically to Sweeney. Approximate clocks/transceiver accounts are not independently verified events or location.
+- **TODOs and full goal:** originals, receipt/custody/retention, call-specific service/clock/leg and complete production joins remain open. All five original tracks/18criteria unchanged; no empirical test or other owner's acceptance claimed.
+- **Revision accountability:** additive supplement and exact TEXT-CHANGES.diff against immediately preceding absence. Previous sources/reports/public history untouched. No new PDF export/layout test needed; actual source images were visually read.
+- **Public review:** selected appropriate original research/locators only; raw sources/rasters/full text, personal/contact/financial/signature data, private case/correspondence/strategy and credentials excluded. No reconstructed redacted identity.
+- **Publication:** requires separate actual AveLyra account/destination/SSH/author/committer/ref/all-file receipts. This checklist does not claim a push, main merge, historical truth or Overview delivery.
+- **Exclusions:** no internet query/new download, contact/outreach/fee/request/filing, experiment, personal mailbox, overwrite, deletion, private push, public-history rewrite or cross-chat transmission.
